 anh l\u1edbn \u1edf b\u00ean kia s\u00f4ng. C\u00e1c anh \u1ea5y t\u1ef1 g\u1ecdi m\u00ecnh l\u00e0 \`Vua B\u1edd S\u00f4ng\`, v\u00e0 t\u1ef1 m\u00e3n l\u1eafm. S\u00e1u tr\u1eadn g\u1ea7n \u0111\u00e2y c\u00e1c anh \u1ea5y th\u1eafng c\u1ea3 s\u00e1u. Ai \u0111\u1ebfn xem c\u0169ng \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c \u1ea1!`},{`en`:`[[Last]] [[week]], [[we]] [[lost]] [[a]] [[practice]] [[match]]. [[In]] [[that]] [[match]], [[the]] [[ball]] [[went|go]] [[into]] [[our]] [[goal]] [[by]] [[itself]]. [[I]] [[was|be]] [[looking|look]] [[at]] [[a]] [[bird]]! [[I]] didn't [[cry]], [[and]] Bin didn't [[cry]] [[either]]. [[Neither]] [[of]] [[us]] [[is|be]] [[a]] [[baby]]. [[Well]], Bin [[cried|cry]] [[a]] [[little]] [[at]] [[home]]. Don't [[tell]] [[anybody]]!`,`vn`:`Tu\u1ea7n tr\u01b0\u1edbc, b\u1ecdn ch\u00e1u thua m\u1ed9t tr\u1eadn t\u1eadp. Trong tr\u1eadn \u0111\u00f3, qu\u1ea3 b\u00f3ng t\u1ef1 l\u0103n v\u00e0o khung th\u00e0nh \u0111\u1ed9i ch\u00e1u. L\u00fac \u1ea5y ch\u00e1u \u0111ang m\u1ea3i ng\u1eafm m\u1ed9t con chim! Ch\u00e1u kh\u00f4ng kh\u00f3c, Bin c\u0169ng kh\u00f4ng kh\u00f3c. Ch\u1eb3ng \u0111\u1ee9a n\u00e0o l\u00e0 em b\u00e9 c\u1ea3. \u00c0, v\u1ec1 nh\u00e0 Bin c\u00f3 kh\u00f3c m\u1ed9t t\u00ed. \u00d4ng \u0111\u1eebng k\u1ec3 v\u1edbi ai nh\u00e9!`},{`en`:`[[Anyway]], [[after]] [[the]] [[match]], [[we]] [[laughed|laugh]] [[at]] [[ourselves]]. Grandma [[made|make]] noodles [[for]] [[the]] [[whole]] [[team]] [[herself]]. [[None]] [[of]] [[my]] [[friends|friend]] [[write]] [[letters|letter]], [[but]] [[they]] [[all]] [[want]] [[to]] [[meet]] [[you]] [[now]].`,`vn`:`M\u00e0 th\u00f4i, \u0111\u00e1 xong, c\u1ea3 \u0111\u1ed9i t\u1ef1 c\u01b0\u1eddi m\u00ecnh. B\u00e0 ch\u00e1u c\u00f2n t\u1ef1 tay n\u1ea5u m\u00ec cho c\u1ea3 \u0111\u1ed9i. Ch\u1eb3ng b\u1ea1n n\u00e0o c\u1ee7a ch\u00e1u vi\u1ebft th\u01b0 c\u1ea3, nh\u01b0ng gi\u1edd \u0111\u1ee9a n\u00e0o c\u0169ng mu\u1ed1n g\u1eb7p \u00f4ng.`},{`en`:`[[Is|be]] [[your]] [[bicycle]] [[still]] [[green]]? Grandma [[says|say]] [[yours]] [[was|be]] [[the]] [[only]] [[green]] [[bicycle]] [[on]] Lotus Street. [[One]] [[day]], [[I]] [[want]] [[to]] [[write]] [[beautiful]] [[letters|letter]] [[myself]]. [[Yours]], Na.`,`vn`:`Xe \u0111\u1ea1p c\u1ee7a \u00f4ng v\u1eabn m\u00e0u xanh ch\u1ee9 \u1ea1? B\u00e0 ch\u00e1u b\u1ea3o xe c\u1ee7a \u00f4ng l\u00e0 chi\u1ebfc xe \u0111\u1ea1p m\u00e0u xanh duy nh\u1ea5t tr\u00ean ph\u1ed1 Hoa Sen. Mai n\u00e0y, ch\u00e1u c\u0169ng mu\u1ed1n t\u1ef1 m\u00ecnh vi\u1ebft \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c nh\u1eefng l\u00e1 th\u01b0 th\u1eadt \u0111\u1eb9p. Th\u00e2n m\u1ebfn, Na.`},{`en`:`Na [[wrote|write]] [[fast]], [[because]] [[practice]] [[started|start]] [[at]] [[five]]. [[She]] [[ran|run]] [[down]] Lotus Street [[to]] [[the]] [[post]] [[office]]. [[There]], [[she]] [[put]] [[her]] [[letter]] [[in]] [[the]] [[old]] [[red]] [[box]] [[in]] [[the]] [[wall]]. [[It]] [[was|be]] [[not]] Mr Huy's [[green]] [[one]]. [[Nobody]] [[opened|open]] [[that]] [[box]] [[any more]].`,`vn`:`Na vi\u1ebft v\u1ed9i, v\u00ec n\u0103m gi\u1edd \u0111\u00e3 b\u1eaft \u0111\u1ea7u bu\u1ed5i t\u1eadp. C\u00f4 b\u00e9 ch\u1ea1y m\u1ed9t m\u1ea1ch xu\u1ed1ng b\u01b0u \u0111i\u1ec7n tr\u00ean ph\u1ed1 Hoa Sen. \u1ede \u0111\u00f3, c\u00f4 b\u1ecf th\u01b0 v\u00e0o chi\u1ebfc h\u00f2m th\u01b0 c\u0169 m\u00e0u \u0111\u1ecf g\u1eafn tr\u00ean t\u01b0\u1eddng, ch\u1ee9 kh\u00f4ng ph\u1ea3i h\u00f2m th\u01b0 xanh c\u1ee7a \u00f4ng Huy. C\u00e1i h\u00f2m \u1ea5y t\u1eeb l\u00e2u \u0111\u00e3 ch\u1eb3ng c\u00f2n ai m\u1edf.`}],`tease`:`L\u00e1 th\u01b0 r\u01a1i v\u00e0o chi\u1ebfc h\u00f2m c\u0169 kh\u00f4ng ai m\u1edf. \u00d4ng Huy c\u00f3 bi\u1ebft Na m\u1eddi \u00f4ng \u0111i xem \u0111\u00e1 b\u00f3ng kh\u00f4ng?`}]}